{"title":"코코로 죠죠루 (5부)","artist":"Nero","sourceId":"reference:df8szcmIG5E927JD9QUb","sourceHash":"7d6c876c52fa9f6bd2bff8b6b29ade59d69f92b9836f31e5bfd964ae60fe9033","performanceStatus":"no_performance_record","timingMethod":"reference_lyric_character_matching","reviewStatus":"draft","cue_timing_confirmed":false,"timingWarning":"(주의) 노래와 함께 타이밍 검증되지 않았음","cues":[{"id":"1","start":0.64,"end":3.3,"text":"我々はみんな「運命の奴隷」なんだよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":3.3,"end":5.36,"text":"無事を祈ってはやれないが","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":5.36,"end":8.74,"text":"彼らが『眠れる奴隷』であることを祈ろう………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":8.94,"end":10.96,"text":"無駄ァァアアッ！　生まれろ……生命よ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":10.96,"end":13.0,"text":"話せッ！　ウソをついてる『味』だぜ……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":13.0,"end":13.5,"text":"チャオ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":13.5,"end":14.38,"text":"動くんじゃあねえッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":14.38,"end":15.56,"text":"『大地獄』行きだぜェーッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":15.56,"end":17.28,"text":"クッ　クッ　クサレ脳ミソがーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":17.28,"end":18.72,"text":"行け　『セックス・ピストルズ』ッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":18.72,"end":19.78,"text":"『ムーディー・ブルース』！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":19.78,"end":21.64,"text":"オレのスタンドで『謎』を解くッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":21.64,"end":22.54,"text":"ナランチャ！アバッキオ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":22.54,"end":23.78,"text":"フーゴ！ミスタ！ジョルノ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":23.78,"end":25.94,"text":"黄金のような『夢』に賭けよう","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":25.96,"end":28.14,"text":"「ボス」じきじきの『命令』なんじゃよ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":28.14,"end":29.98,"text":"護衛は今より始まる！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":29.98,"end":31.44,"text":"そこだ！『エアロスミス』！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":31.44,"end":32.56,"text":"しょうがねーなぁ～～","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":32.56,"end":34.46,"text":"もっとでっかくしてやるぜェ～～～～ッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":34.46,"end":35.42,"text":"『マン・イン・ザ・ミラー』！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":35.42,"end":36.86,"text":"くらわせろーッ『パープル・ヘイズ』ッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":36.86,"end":38.78,"text":"覚悟はいいか？オレはできてる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":38.78,"end":40.66,"text":"「ブッ殺す」！　と思ったならッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":40.66,"end":42.92,"text":"スデに行動は終わっているんだッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":42.92,"end":43.82,"text":"アリーヴェデルチ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":43.82,"end":45.26,"text":"ディ・モールト よくやった！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":45.26,"end":47.46,"text":"「屈辱ある死」で支払ってもらうぜ!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":47.46,"end":49.32,"text":"やりたいようにやったところで","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":49.32,"end":51.24,"text":"無駄だったようだな　どっちみち…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":51.24,"end":53.62,"text":"『ホワイト・アルバム ジェントリー・ウィープス！』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":53.62,"end":55.4,"text":"真の「覚悟」はここからだッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":55.4,"end":57.54,"text":"「覚悟」とは！！暗闇の荒野に！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":57.54,"end":59.9,"text":"進むべき道を切り開く事だッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":59.9,"end":61.82,"text":"あたし…これからどうなるの？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":61.82,"end":64.1,"text":"父親の事……好きになれるのかしら？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":64.1,"end":65.1,"text":"なにイィィィィィィィッーッ！！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":65.1,"end":66.92,"text":"吐き気をもよおす『邪悪』とはッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":66.92,"end":69.84,"text":"なにも知らぬ無知なる者を利用する事だ……!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":69.84,"end":72.78,"text":"自分の利益だけのために利用する事だ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":72.78,"end":73.52,"text":"ゆるさねえッ!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":73.52,"end":75.08,"text":"あんたは今　再びッ!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":75.08,"end":76.72,"text":"オレの心を『裏切った』ッ!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":76.72,"end":78.88,"text":"くらえ！『スティッキィー・フィンガーズ!!』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":78.88,"end":80.9,"text":"見えるッ!　これが『キング・クリムゾン!!』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":80.9,"end":83.5,"text":"『時間を消し去って』飛び越えさせた…!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"47","start":83.5,"end":85.18,"text":"今！この血の流れは断ち切るッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"48","start":85.18,"end":86.48,"text":"「任務」は終わっただと？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"49","start":86.48,"end":89.56,"text":"トリッシュは…おれ自身の命令で護衛するッ!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"50","start":89.56,"end":91.08,"text":"ジョルノ！アバッキオ！ミスタ!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"51","start":91.08,"end":92.16,"text":"ブチャラティィィィィィィィィィ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"52","start":92.16,"end":94.16,"text":"オレも行くッ！行くんだよォーッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"53","start":94.16,"end":95.64,"text":"あたしはどうしても知りたい！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"54","start":95.64,"end":98.2,"text":"自分が何者から生まれたのかをッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"55","start":98.2,"end":100.04,"text":"ひとりずつだ！ティッツァーノ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"56","start":100.04,"end":101.46,"text":"ナランチャを使ってな…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"57","start":101.46,"end":102.72,"text":"見つけ………たぞオオオオオオ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"58","start":102.72,"end":104.64,"text":"我々の「勝利」にかわりはない！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"59","start":104.64,"end":106.88,"text":"『クラッシュ』！喰いやぶれェェェェェ のどをヲヲヲヲヲオオオオオオオオオオ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"60","start":106.88,"end":108.64,"text":"ひるむ………と！思うのか……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"61","start":108.64,"end":110.28,"text":"これしきの事でよォォォオオオオ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"62","start":110.28,"end":111.28,"text":"ボラーレ・ヴィーア","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"63","start":111.28,"end":111.9,"text":"なにィイイイイイイイ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"64","start":111.9,"end":114.1,"text":"死んでるのにスタンド能力だと……!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"65","start":114.1,"end":117.4,"text":"『柔ラカイ』トイウ事ハ『ダイヤモンド』ヨリモ壊レナイッ!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"66","start":117.4,"end":119.2,"text":"そう……一味違うのね………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"67","start":119.2,"end":119.72,"text":"見せろッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"68","start":119.72,"end":122.14,"text":"絶望をわたしの方に向けながら","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"69","start":122.14,"end":122.88,"text":"落下していけええええええええええ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"70","start":122.88,"end":123.42,"text":"ベネ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"71","start":123.42,"end":126.06,"text":"そんなオイシイ話があると思うのか？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"72","start":126.06,"end":127.8,"text":"おまえの様な人間に","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"73","start":127.8,"end":128.48,"text":"無駄ァァアアッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"74","start":128.48,"end":129.82,"text":"『ゴールド・エクスペリエンス』!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"75","start":129.82,"end":130.56,"text":"WAAAAAAANNABEEEEEEEEEE！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"76","start":130.56,"end":131.22,"text":"『スパイス・ガール』ッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"77","start":131.22,"end":132.1,"text":"アリーヴェデルチ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"78","start":132.1,"end":134.28,"text":"うぶな事…じゃなくて…　味な事か？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"79","start":134.28,"end":136.4,"text":"国語の教師かオメーはよォォォォ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"80","start":136.4,"end":137.22,"text":"これは「試練」だ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"81","start":137.22,"end":140.56,"text":"過去に打ち勝てという「試練」と　オレは受け取った","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"82","start":140.56,"end":141.7,"text":"ポルナレフッ！　ディアボロ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"83","start":141.7,"end":142.84,"text":"今度は逃さないッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"84","start":142.84,"end":145.12,"text":"『希望』だけは…　守らなくては","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"85","start":145.12,"end":147.02,"text":"『キング・クリムゾン』……「エピタフ（墓碑銘）」","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"86","start":147.02,"end":149.14,"text":"「光と影」…！『二重の人格』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"87","start":149.14,"end":151.34,"text":"おお わたしのかわいいドッピオ………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"88","start":151.34,"end":153.14,"text":"オレはおまえに………近づかない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"89","start":153.14,"end":155.34,"text":"知りたいぞ　お前が何なのか………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"90","start":155.34,"end":156.42,"text":"「過去」というものは","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"91","start":156.42,"end":159.26,"text":"人間の真の平和をがんじがらめにする","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"92","start":159.26,"end":161.16,"text":"父の過去を追跡するのよ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"93","start":161.16,"end":164.08,"text":"『結果』だけだ!! この世には『結果』だけが残る!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"94","start":164.08,"end":166.94,"text":"そうだな…わたしは「結果」だけを求めてはいない","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"95","start":166.94,"end":170.52,"text":"「結果」だけを求めていると近道をしたがるものだ……………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"96","start":170.52,"end":172.26,"text":"やる気もしだいに失せていく","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"97","start":172.26,"end":176.26,"text":"大切なのは『真実に向かおうとする意志』だと思っている","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"98","start":176.26,"end":177.88,"text":"いつかはたどり着くだろう？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"99","start":177.88,"end":179.76,"text":"向かっているわけだからな……………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"100","start":179.76,"end":181.36,"text":"違うかい？アバッキオ……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"101","start":181.36,"end":183.28,"text":"体がッ　いや…精神がッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"102","start":183.28,"end":185.68,"text":"肉体を越えて入れ替わったのかよーッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"103","start":185.68,"end":187.2,"text":"いいか……!!「矢」は敵ではない！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"104","start":187.2,"end":188.42,"text":"だが味方でもないッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"105","start":188.42,"end":189.28,"text":"「希望」なのだッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"106","start":189.28,"end":191.18,"text":"やったぞッ!!ブチャラティは無事だ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"107","start":191.18,"end":192.32,"text":"これでもう終わる…!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"108","start":192.32,"end":193.52,"text":"トリッシュ…お願いだ…","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"109","start":193.52,"end":194.6,"text":"全然わからない…………!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"110","start":194.6,"end":195.94,"text":"ぼくを前へ…じゃまだ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"111","start":195.94,"end":197.74,"text":"絶対にありえん！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"112","start":197.74,"end":198.54,"text":"ナランチャーッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"113","start":198.54,"end":199.94,"text":"すでに始まっていたッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"114","start":199.94,"end":200.56,"text":"ミスタァァァーッ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"115","start":200.56,"end":202.3,"text":"『レクイエム』を止めるんだッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"116","start":202.3,"end":204.46,"text":"この中の誰かにヤツは隠れている…！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"117","start":204.46,"end":205.54,"text":"そこを動くな!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"118","start":205.54,"end":206.42,"text":"やるしかない………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"119","start":206.42,"end":207.28,"text":"『贈り物』だッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"120","start":207.28,"end":210.64,"text":"過去を乗り越えた運命からの「貢ぎ物」だったなあああああ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"121","start":210.64,"end":211.74,"text":"つかんだぞ………『矢』を!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"122","start":211.74,"end":214.84,"text":"「ゴールド・E」は今…発現する!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"123","start":214.84,"end":215.44,"text":"トリィィィィィィィーシュ!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"124","start":215.44,"end":216.94,"text":"「帝王」はこのディアボロだッ!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"125","start":216.94,"end":217.6,"text":"うおぉぉぉおおおおおおぉおおおおぉ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"126","start":217.6,"end":218.22,"text":"こっ……これはッ!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"127","start":218.22,"end":219.4,"text":"この風は…　なにッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"128","start":219.4,"end":222.16,"text":"この世で「矢」を持つにふさわしい王は誰か！？","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"129","start":222.16,"end":223.68,"text":"全ては元に戻るッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"130","start":223.68,"end":224.66,"text":"ブチャラティ…………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"131","start":224.66,"end":225.18,"text":"あとは………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"132","start":225.18,"end":226.6,"text":"ジョルノ…まかせたぞ………………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"133","start":226.6,"end":228.36,"text":"終わりのないのが『終わり』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"134","start":228.36,"end":231.36,"text":"それが『ゴールド・E・レクイエム』","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"135","start":231.36,"end":233.88,"text":"オレは仲間のところに戻らなくては…!!!","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"136","start":233.88,"end":236.36,"text":"おまえがいれば…希望があるかもしれねえ","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"137","start":236.36,"end":238.14,"text":"道がッ！暗闇に見えたぜッ！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"138","start":238.14,"end":240.0,"text":"乗り越えるわ………登り切ってやる","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"139","start":240.0,"end":242.24,"text":"運命とは『眠れる奴隷』だ……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"140","start":242.24,"end":244.76,"text":"オレたちはそれを解き放つことができた……","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"141","start":244.76,"end":246.96,"text":"『誠の行動』は………滅びはしない………","translation":"","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"142","start":246.96,"end":250.04,"text":"このジョルノ・ジョバァーナには『夢』がある！","translation":"","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[]}